  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 180C, fan-forced. Halve the carrot and cucumber widthwise, then thinly slice. Stack the slices and cut into thin matchsticks. Pick the coriander leaves, discarding the stems.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2927350/photos/large/prep_ingredients-4f36783f277deae041a80059e6d2e126.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pickle veggies: Put 1 tbs white vinegar, 3 tsp sugar and 2 tsp boiling water in a large bowl and stir until the sugar dissolves. Add the carrot and cucumber and toss to combine. Set aside to pickle, tossing occasionally, until needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2927351/photos/large/pickle_veggies-f5d484dfbea32dba5dda8ecd00d4d8fc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm rolls: Cut a slit lengthwise down the middle of the rolls, taking care not to cut all the way through. Put the rolls on an oven tray and bake for 8 mins or until warmed through and crusty.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2927352/photos/large/warm_rolls-bb3f4c71f8c366609e9ab67f223d173e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm tofu: Meanwhile, heat 2 tsp vegetable oil in a medium frypan over medium heat. Cook the tofu, turning, for 4 mins or until warmed through. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2927353/photos/large/warm_tofu-111585e6116bd9d651c44ebacd8cce4e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Drain the pickled veggies. Thinly slice the tofu. Spread the rolls with 2 tbs mayonnaise (see Make it vegan) and fill with the pickled veggies, tofu and coriander leaves. Drizzle with the sweet chilli sauce and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2927354/photos/large/serve_up-a3ef7dfda955c17af34cc99d65a64b30.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it vegan: This dish is vegetarian but it's easy to make it suitable for vegans too. Just make sure you're using a vegan-friendly mayo, and it's good to go!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2927355/photos/large/make_it_vegan-f877483f1e50639d7dde2b679006bdc5.jpeg"
    }
  ]
